# No Cursor / AI co-author

Never add Cursor, Composer, Agent, Auto, or any AI identity as co-author or attribution on commits, PRs, CODEOWNERS, or README authors.

- No `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or any AI trailer)
- No `Made-with: Cursor` / `Generated-by: Cursor`
- Strip any such trailer before committing if a hook/template adds it
